OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies in car crash on busy
OL,4,Aroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 60s has died in a car
OL,7,Fcrash on a busy stretch of road.
OL,9,FNorthumbria police said the crash
OL,10,Fhappened on the A69 between Haydon
OL,11,FBridge and Hexham at about 13:30 BST on
OL,12,FSaturday.
OL,14,FA black Honda travelling westbound was
OL,15,Fin collision with a Volkswagen Tiguan
OL,16,Fbeing driven by the woman in the
OL,17,Fopposite direction, the force said.
OL,19,FThe diver of the Honda, a man in his
OL,20,F30s, suffered serious but not
OL,21,Flife-threatening injuries and was taken
OL,22,Fto hospital, police said.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
